«
@@ ============================================================
@@ MinΔVTraj — optimal launch window (min ΔV over departure date AND flight time)
@@ 2-D ternary search over TrCost. Keep the window under the 180° ridge. Slow (see AstronTXPrecision).
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : 'Af' 'Bf' t1_lo t1_hi tof_lo tof_hi   ( 'Af' 'Bf' t1_lo t1_hi tof_lo tof_hi -- { ΔV t₁ tof } )
@@ Output : { ΔV t₁ tof }
@@ VALIDATION (device-confirmed):
@@   '♁Pf' '♂Pf' 2459030 2459075 150 225 MinΔVTraj -> { 6.31693 2459055.70 205.38 }  (Mars 2020, level 3)
@@ ============================================================
 → Af Bf t1lo t1hi toflo tofhi
  « 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 → lo hi m1 m2 dv1 dv2 t1opt niter
    «
      '3·AstronTXPrecision+3' EVAL 'niter' STO
      t1lo →Num 'lo' STO  t1hi →Num 'hi' STO
      1 niter START
        'lo+(hi-lo)/3' EVAL 'm1' STO
        'hi-(hi-lo)/3' EVAL 'm2' STO
        m1 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV 1 GET 'dv1' STO
        m2 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV 1 GET 'dv2' STO
        IF dv1 dv2 < THEN m2 'hi' STO ELSE m1 'lo' STO END
      NEXT
      'lo+(hi-lo)/2' EVAL 't1opt' STO
      t1opt Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV
      DUP 1 GET  t1opt  ROT 2 GET  3 →LIST
    »
  »
»
